Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:26.42,Main,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}The Adventures of Fran{\i0}"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:34.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's like {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not just that the name\Nis the same as Miss Fran's--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like the face here looks like her, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,As I looked at that book,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I remembered a country\NI stopped by six months before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:53.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a big country, far away from here--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:57.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It was called Royal Celesteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:41.00,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"Royal Celesteria"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The mages are doing tricks\Nfor everyone to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Put your hands together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,"Royal Magic Academy"...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they had a place like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:38.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's okay to go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.67,0:03:40.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Probably not, right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:43.38,Main,,0,0,0,,But... I'll just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,No trespassers allowed here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. You're a witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Please excuse my rude behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:00.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed inside without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even witches?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:11.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:17.46,Main,,0,0,0,,He could've at least let me\Nlook around a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:20.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess I'll look for a place to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that person\Nis delivering newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The mages in this country are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:49.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello. You're the Ashen Witch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,W-We're students at the Royal Magic Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you students from\Nthe school I was at earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.46,0:04:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What business do you have with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:05.50,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um, will you come with us\Nwithout asking any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.50,0:05:07.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I said without asking any questi--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:15.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:18.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Just trust me and come with us, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:32.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, let's do this as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:35.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's catch her together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch me? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't take all the glory for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:45.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The Ashen Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Please don't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys go toward the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:06:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And you guys go around\Nfrom the state guest house!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.96,0:06:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Found you, Madam Ashen Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Please come with us quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:19.88,Main,,0,0,0,,They do have the advantage\Nof knowing the lay of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,They're stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,They're determined, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well. In that case,\NI'll see this through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.46,0:06:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Ashen Witch, I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You should really open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Ashen Witch, I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I can't go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:15.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm dying...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:21.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You should know by now that you\Ncan't catch me even if you try as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Please give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,--Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:25.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Everyone, good work.\N--Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:28.29,Main,,0,0,0,,--Everyone, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Ma'am...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:37.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You all had no chance against her, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.13,0:07:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Age doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the difference between you and a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:52.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:54.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:08:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I'd seen\Nmy teacher, Miss Fran, in a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:05.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it for today's extracurricular lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Please turn in your report tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:15.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, they're all so unsteady on their feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe you overdid it a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying it's my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It's also my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:25.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you a teacher at this school, Miss Fran?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. The king asked me to teach here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:30.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, let's not stand\Naround here talking all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:38.79,Main,,0,0,0,,As part of their extracurricular lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I told them to bring you to me,\Neven if they had to use some force.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you know that I was in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.67,0:08:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You tried to come into the school, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,A young witch with\Nash-colored hair tried to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:09:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,She might be a spy from another country!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:04.88,Main,,0,0,0,,A spy? He really jumped to conclusions...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:07.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew right away that it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I just couldn't sit still,\Nso I used my students to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:16.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be hard to find you\Nmyself in such a big country,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,and it would be good training for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.50,0:09:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Because going up against\Na talented witch is excellent training.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:29.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Talented? Well, I guess\Nyou could say that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:34.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a rare opportunity,\Nso those kids were happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I was, too, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You've traveled a lot, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:48.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You knew that I was traveling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:49.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard from your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You've seen her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,She's very worried about you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.50,0:10:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're ever near your\Nhometown, you should go visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm planning to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.88,0:10:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,So, why did you want to\Nbecome a traveler, Elaina?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I expect it was because of your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It was mainly because of a book\Ncalled {\i1}The Adventures of Niké{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,which I read when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I like that book, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:28.25,Main,,0,0,0,,My favorite is the last story,\N"Foula, the Apprentice Witch."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my favorite, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:33.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the story of how the witch, Niké,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,takes on the apprentice witch,\NFoula, and helps her grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.21,0:10:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,In the end, Niké lives in the\Ncountryside as an ordinary woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,and Foula becomes the new traveler\Nas the curtain falls on Niké's adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was talking about this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:58.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Just between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I loved{\i1} The Adventures of Niké {\i0}so much\Nthat I wrote a novel as I traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't sound very interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no, I'm super interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.33,0:11:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,After I hit about a hundred pages\Nof manuscript and went back to read it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:23.83,Main,,0,0,0,,it was so pathetic that it\Nmade me writhe on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't take it out of my travel bag\Nafter that and forgot about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:34.75,Main,,0,0,0,,but when I was in a certain\Ncountry, I sold my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Apparently, that bag was\Nthe bag of a legendary traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.42,Main,,0,0,0,,A legendary traveler's bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.42,0:11:44.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a cheap bag I'd bought\Nin a pawnshop, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.25,0:11:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,And you left your manuscript in that bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Who {\i1}wouldn't {\i0}have been able to figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember it occasionally,\Nand it makes me so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:12:01.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What if someone found\Nthe manuscript and read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:07.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's something I can laugh about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:09.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So what was the point of telling me about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.67,0:12:12.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,A lot of things will happen to you\Nas you continue on your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'd like to hear\Nstories of your fun memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please tell me lots of\Nstories about your travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure you write in your diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You even heard about that from my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:37.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and so is your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.33,0:12:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I can't get lazy about writing in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.21,0:12:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I believe you met her yesterday,\Nbut let me introduce her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Ashen Witch, Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.79,0:12:52.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,She'll be a special guest lecturer today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have any questions for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:12:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,--Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,--Do you have a boyfriend? Do you?\N--Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:02.21,Main,,0,0,0,,--Do you have a boyfriend? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I do not. I'm a traveler after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.75,0:13:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please keep it to questions about magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:16.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What kind of magic are you good at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,There's isn't one specific type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,From attack magic to transformation magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like I have a good handle\Non all kinds of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Of all the countries you've ever visited,\Nwhich one was your favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:34.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I like this one best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:35.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:37.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you just trying to flatter us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I really mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,The Peaceful Country of Robetta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it fun being a traveler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, very!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:50.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got a question!\NWhat about your panties? What color--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I instructed the students alongside Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The flow of your magic is going wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:16.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm your mind more and stabilize your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:23.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop playing with making\Nyour water into the shape of a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't get my water to form a clean ball shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:34.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You're using too much excess magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Try relaxing your power a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:38.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Relax my power...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You relaxed too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um... There's something\NI'd like you to help me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.00,0:14:51.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm bad at manipulating water...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I can barely lift it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Please try doing it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.33,0:15:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:15.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like you haven't quite\Ngotten the hang of it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I think you should try practicing\Njust getting the water out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:27.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you get the water out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:30.75,Main,,0,0,0,,return it to the bucket right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:33.29,Main,,0,0,0,,And then pull it out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:35.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If you keep practicing this,\NI think you'll start to get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.75,0:15:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:16:00.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't usually teach things to other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,so with one thing and another,\NI had a pretty good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:48.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to show you before\Nyou left again on your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I love this view.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It really is a lovely view.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll leave tomorrow morning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.83,0:17:07.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:11.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I think the students really like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:12.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:15.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just unusual to see a young witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:19.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll be sad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What will the students at the\Nacademy do once they graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:27.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Delivering packages, flying people around--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,There are many different jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Are the street performers who use\Nmagic also graduates of the academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they getting paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:45.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Not very much, but I'm sure they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:51.13,Main,,0,0,0,,But you know, they're not showcasing\Ntheir magic because they want money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:54.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It's because they like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're traveling\Nbecause you like it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,They're doing it because\Nthey like making people happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Because they like it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,There were many times when I felt\Nthat this was a wonderful country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The beautiful streets, the smiling people...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I was moved every time I saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:32.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It could be that the country,\NRoyal Celesteria, overlapped with my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\Nwhat are some things you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.71,0:18:39.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking that all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I like traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Other than traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I like books?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.13,0:18:46.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing, I was just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:54.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to give me a parting gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:59.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, you don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say that. For example,\Ndo you like flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a leading question, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:08.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, what about flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:10.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, butterflies are nice, too, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what {\i1}you {\i0}like, Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't like butterflies?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,They're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. You like them okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,So what about flowers, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're back to flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.71,Main,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I do like them...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:35.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you like flowers.\NLet's meet at the city gates tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She's not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought, "Miss Fran is probably\Nplanning on giving me flowers."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.63,0:19:49.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,but flowers wouldn't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If I saw the same flowers in another country,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:20:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I would remember Miss Fran and my time here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:03.08,Main,,0,0,0,,and it might make me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I decided to leave on my journey\Nwithout waiting for Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Because then, I might not have\Nto have those sad feelings later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:18.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Miss Fran.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:29.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Elaina,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:44.63,Main,,0,0,0,,you chose to become a traveler yourself,\Nso I don't have the right to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.63,0:20:49.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is all I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:54.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Did it make you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:58.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, very!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The students and I are cheering\Nfor you from the bottom of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Please do not forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you all, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:13.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure you come back and visit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:15.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll wait with open arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Until then, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:33.29,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a witch flying over grasslands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,She looks excited, like she's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of country will she visit next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What kinds of people will she meet next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.38,0:21:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Her heart was filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.17,0:21:49.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Who was this traveler?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a little too cool-looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.63,0:23:43.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like the next time I see Miss Fran,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.33,0:23:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have a really\Ninteresting story to tell her.
